# ---- Shizuku test harness runtime artifacts (CONTAIN A LIVE TOKEN) ----
# The harness mints a per-install 128-bit authorization token and the CLI reads
# it from this file. It is written to the app-private device dir
# (/sdcard/Android/data/<pkg>/files/nexg-test/), not the repo, but if a run is
# ever redirected here it must still never be committed.
nexg-test-token.txt
nexg-test-reply.json

